 돋움체\">단</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">일괄수강신청된 내역은 신입생 본인의 임의 수강삭제,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">취소를 불허함</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20.1pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">재수강 취득성적은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">A</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">이하만 가능</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">재수강을 원하면 해당과목 혹은 동일인</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">정 또는 </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">대체이수된 과목을 수강신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청 시 재수강여부에 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">Y</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">표시는 재수강과목임을 나타냄</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">변경은 정해진 기간 이외에는 할 수 없음</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ </span></span><strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청 공지사항 첨부물</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">[</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\"><u>수강신청 안내문</u>,&nbsp;<u>교육과정표</u>&nbsp;필독</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">]</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">을 숙지한 후 신청</span></strong></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ 계약학과 개설 강좌는 수강신청 불가</span></span></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">수강지도상담 결과 조회</span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">○ </span></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담 승인</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">/</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">미승인 내역은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">원스톱서비스</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">상담</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></u></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담</span></u></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">에서 조회 </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움체\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">본인의 수강신청 소홀 및 대리수강신청 등에 따른 착오로 인하여 졸업을 하지 못하는 학생이 매학기 발생하고 있으니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강신청을 소홀히 하여 불이익을 당하지 않도록 유의하여야 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">특히 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">2006</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학년도부터 공학교육인증과정이 도입되었으니</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 2015</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">학년도 교육과정표 내 본인 학과 교육과정을 확실히 숙지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">수강지도상담 필요</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움체\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움체\">한 후 수강신청하시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2015. 2. 3. </span></p><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
